LAMPUNG PROVINCE

REGIONAL REGULATION OF TANGGAMUS REGENCY

NUMBER 2 OF 2024

CONCERNING

IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

REGENT OF TANGGAMUS,

Considering : a. that in order to protect the constitutional rights of women and children in accordance with the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia, the Regional

Government is obliged to be responsible in the implementation of protection of women and children against acts of violence;

b. that to meet the indicators of

Implementation of Child-Friendly Regency, with regard to Protection services, prevention of violence against women and children, regulations are needed to govern the various roles of regional apparatus institutions and other institutions;

c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letters a and b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation on

Implementation of Protection of Women and Children;

In view of : 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;

2. Law Number 39 of 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette

of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);

3. Law Number 1 of 1974 concerning Marriage (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1974 Number 1, Supplement to the State Gazette

of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3019), as has been amended several times most recently by Law

